You can take a look at
your brand new workplace.

266
00:19:36,460 --> 00:19:37,290
Got it.

267
00:19:37,600 --> 00:19:41,180
Of course, I get to be a member of...

268
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:43,760
The Demon Defense Force.

269
00:19:45,420 --> 00:19:46,380
Welcome home!

270
00:19:47,280 --> 00:19:51,000
The siblings we rescued are back
home with their parents. Good.

271
00:19:53,980 --> 00:19:55,240
So... who is he?

272
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:57,860
Everyone meet Yuki Wakura.

273
00:19:58,140 --> 00:19:59,880
He's our new caretaker. Huh?

274
00:20:01,580 --> 00:20:02,410
Huh?

275
00:20:03,140 --> 00:20:04,160
Hold on a minute.

276
00:20:04,320 --> 00:20:05,560
I'm the caretaker?

277
00:20:05,760 --> 00:20:08,217
Of course, during combat,
you will be my slave.

278
00:20:08,300 --> 00:20:10,957
But at all other times, you
will tend to the dorm's needs.

279
00:20:11,040 --> 00:20:11,870
Huh?

280
00:20:11,953 --> 00:20:12,783
Really?

281
00:20:12,866 --> 00:20:17,377
I went to an all-girls school, so I've
never gotten a good look at a man before.

282
00:20:17,460 --> 00:20:18,695
This ought to be fun.

283
00:20:18,820 --> 00:20:22,440
Having a new person in the
dorm means he's Nace Jr.

284
00:20:23,100 --> 00:20:24,140
But a man?

285
00:20:24,600 --> 00:20:26,800
A man is gonna be our caretaker?

286
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:31,237
These girls are skilled fighters,
but they have colorful personalities.

287
00:20:31,320 --> 00:20:35,157
Coupled with the Shuuki lurking about, our
caretakers don't stick around for long.

288
00:20:35,240 --> 00:20:37,817
With your housekeeping expertise,
you'll be the perfect fit.

289
00:20:37,900 --> 00:20:40,697
Wait, I don't get to be on
the Demon Defense Force?

290
00:20:40,780 --> 00:20:43,604
Don't be ridiculous, men
aren't allowed to join.

291
00:20:45,060 --> 00:20:46,119
There you have it.

292
00:20:46,780 --> 00:20:48,197
Make him feel at home, okay?

293
00:20:48,280 --> 00:20:49,751
If you say so, Commander.

294
00:20:50,860 --> 00:20:52,540
The carpet he's tending to!

295
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:53,661
Take it out now!

296
00:20:54,480 --> 00:20:55,477
I'm starving!

297
00:20:55,560 --> 00:20:57,031
Make me something to eat.

298
00:20:57,140 --> 00:20:59,375
Do you mind washing my uniform for me?

299
00:21:00,140 --> 00:21:00,970
Slow down!

300
00:21:01,140 --> 00:21:02,493
I can't work that fast!

301
00:21:03,100 --> 00:21:04,420
Don't worry about it!

302
00:21:04,660 --> 00:21:07,857
Nei was the last one to join
the seventh squadron before you!

303
00:21:07,940 --> 00:21:09,920
As your senpai, I'm here to help!

304
00:21:10,200 --> 00:21:11,612
Everything will be okay!

305
00:21:11,800 --> 00:21:12,837
Oh, thanks a lot.

306
00:21:12,920 --> 00:21:14,600
But, um, how old are you?

307
00:21:14,760 --> 00:21:16,500
Mei is 11 years old!

308
00:21:16,700 --> 00:21:21,288
She has seniority over you in the 7th
Squadron, so you better not disobey her!

309
00:21:21,560 --> 00:21:23,880
Taking orders from a literal child.

310
00:21:24,220 --> 00:21:25,380
Well, at any rate.

311
00:21:27,900 --> 00:21:31,260
Welcome home to Mato's Elite 7th Squadron.

312
00:21:35,780 --> 00:21:36,610
Thanks!

313
00:22:11,440 --> 00:22:12,840
All right, let's do it.

314
00:22:48,540 --> 00:22:50,580
If you take your two hands,

315
00:22:51,120 --> 00:22:52,414
take your three hands.

316
00:22:53,180 --> 00:22:54,827
It's a pain that you're sad.

317
00:22:56,560 --> 00:23:01,220
I'm a little bit of a
chain I'll never leave you.

318
00:23:02,480 --> 00:23:05,180
I'll never leave you.

319
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:16,117
Okay, I'm going to talk to you about
Commander Kyoko's Peach Ability, Slave.

320
00:23:16,200 --> 00:23:18,977
She can use someone as her slave
for a brief period of time,

321
00:23:19,060 --> 00:23:21,857
but with this ability, she's
required to give them a reward.

322
00:23:21,940 --> 00:23:23,697
The Shuki's reward was well-meet.

323
00:23:23,780 --> 00:23:24,737
I wonder what Mr.

324
00:23:24,820 --> 00:23:25,937
Caretaker's reward is.

325
00:23:26,020 --> 00:23:27,800
I'm curious. By the way,

326
00:23:27,900 --> 00:23:29,717
the commander defeating
all of those Shuki with

327
00:23:29,800 --> 00:23:32,097
a sword has nothing to do
with her Peach Ability.

328
00:23:32,180 --> 00:23:34,417
It's the result of her
hard work and discipline.

329
00:23:34,500 --> 00:23:35,657
No one else can do that.

330
00:23:35,740 --> 00:23:38,660
Anyway, next time,
Curiosity Shushu Undress.
